It was fate that brought me and my rescue pup, Mr. Harvey, together in 2010.  It has been pure bliss ever since.  I hope that everyone gets the chance to feel the real joy that comes from rescuing a pet in need of a home. They just make everything better.
Director: Gabe Evans, thegabeevans.com
Original Song: Lauren Hulbert, laurenhulbert.com
Art Direction: Stephanie Todaro, houseofharvey.com